atus="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>7100833</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1108512A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>BRIDGESTONE CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO TAIZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OBAYASHI AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>BRIDGESTONE CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, TAIZO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OBAYASHI, AKIO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO TAIZO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OBAYASHI AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, TAIZO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OBAYASHI, AKIO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A metal mold change device, comprising a transfer means to transfer metal molds located on the outside of a vulcanizer into the vulcanizer and retrieve the metal molds located inside the vulcanizer to the outside, the transfer means comprising a height adjusting means to adjust the transfer height of the metal molds and a metal mold positioning means relative to the vulcanizer, whereby, despite the fact that its structure is simple, the metal molds can be centered accurately relative to the vulcanizer for centering, the metal molds can be transferred into and retrieved from the vulcanizer smoothly and easily, and a transfer time and a retrieval time can be reduced remarkably to increase a metal mold change efficiency.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un appareil de changement de moule métallique comprenant un dispositif de transfert destiné à transférer des moules métalliques se trouvant à l'extérieur d'une installation de vulcanisation dans l'installation de vulcanisation et à retirer les moules métallique se trouvant à l'intérieur de l'installation de vulcanisation pour les placer à l'extérieur, le dispositif de transfert comportant un dispositif de réglage de hauteur destiné à régler la hauteur de transfert des moules métalliques, et un dispositif de positionnement de moule par rapport à l'installation de vulcanisation. Ainsi, malgré la simplicité de la structure de l'installation de vulcanisation, on peut centrer les moules métalliques avec précision par rapport à l'installation de vulcanisation, on peut transférer les moules métalliques à l'intérieur de l'installation de vulcanisation et les en retirer facilement et en douceur, et on peut réduire considérablement le temps de transfert et le temps de retrait, ce qui permet d'accroître l'efficacité d'une opération de changement de moule métallique.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>